[{"title":"西湖同李水部孟玉詹进士泮","author":"郑善夫","text":"春城万水散晴湖，南北高峰相对孤。\n雨后舟航分气象，年来心迹落虚无。\n只妨鱼鸟催人事，不厌菩提混世途。\n小折梅花携二子，竟无秀句吊林逋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋京华玩月","author":"郑善夫","text":"上谷诸城紫气通，辉辉星月自离宫。\n关山万马黄陀北，殿阙三秋白露中。\n大将此时须缚虎，侍臣何地合从龙。\n绳枢瓮牖长消息，愁绝京华鼓角风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昔余北征太初至自湖州送余至姑胥吾惟可至自三衢送余至槜李不二载间相继下世重逢此地怆然伤怀作哭二子诗","author":"郑善夫","text":"忆从把抱三吴志，念尔攀翻远道来。\n此后音尘一哭耳，旧时风雨竟何哉。\n江山秪挂南州剑，天地空生诸葛才。\n槜李姑胥是永别，暮云邻篴动秋哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李中丞邀游南高峰与棠陵子同赋","author":"郑善夫","text":"南峰东下对扶桑，海雾天风引望长。\n此日登临成胜会，眼中文物傍重阳。\n避人鹳鹤遥相过，近郭棕篁好自苍。\n笑把荷衣接豸服，狂夫谈讨只沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏朝覃山即事二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"湖水淼淼横钓舟，湖边人家生事幽。\n胡麻塞畦众作动，桑柘满地春蚕收。\n卑枝不肯受冠盖，短草何妨弥阻修。\n吴侬礼数亦自好，方巾野衣迎道周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏朝覃山即事二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"四月覃山茶树香，蹋歌采茶多女郎。\n孤亭小池长杜若，斜川细雨飞鸳鸯。\n岛屿历历渺云水，烟波茫茫连大荒。\n眼中春花复欲尽，未得及春归故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答樗翁见怀次韵","author":"郑善夫","text":"上日南湖春草馀，飞椷报我茂陵居。\n秪益停云承笑语，还闻抱朴入空虚。\n苦遭疟鬼时相泥，愁见鸥群晚自如。\n世短途难身独远，京华新订绝交书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莆诸君子邀游木兰宿云庄溪阁因饯余涌江把袂而别怅然兴怀","author":"郑善夫","text":"莆阳名士太古流，爱余来并木兰舟。\n诗书礼乐话未了，琴瑟笙簧歌少休。\n三秋问俗风尘切，一路看山花鸟愁。\n此别应知各努力，思君无那海东头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日同剑川诸子登马坑诸山望九峰道南祠记事","author":"郑善夫","text":"南平县北重阳至，强起登高风雨朝。\n乌帽黄花修旧事，风流人物忆前朝。\n东南形胜山川固，闽粤衣冠气象饶。\n千树早霜寒自积，一潭秋水澹相摇。\n汉王俎豆还宫庙，刘守勋名已寂寥。\n群盗檄书随处满，万方兵甲几时销。\n年荒白昼三军噪，日远黄堂五马骄。\n病后故人俱杳莫，幸然胜事不萧条。\n人兼邺下何须避，谊重淮南定见招。\n青眼岂辞鹦鹉盏，白袍更上木兰桡。\n四贤道近源流断，双剑龙潜岁月遥。\n桂树丛生江草长，不妨志士遁渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宋宫故基","author":"郑善夫","text":"西门数顷地，旧是帝王宫。\n莫谩歌禾黍，山河涕泪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病居读顾与新诗","author":"郑善夫","text":"伏枕殊方客，秋风岁载阴。\n头风顿觉愈，吾只爱陈琳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚客","author":"郑善夫","text":"楚客望不返，行坐楚天心。\n荆门未可涉，洞庭波正深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬青树","author":"郑善夫","text":"道傍冬青树，人好树亦好。\n岂不缠风雷，青青自持保。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜变歌三章 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"洪江通海潮，朝往复暮来。\n岊水下洪江，何时逐潮回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜变歌三章 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"我欲渡螺江，螺女不可遇。\n人知子夜来，不知子夜去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜变歌三章 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"汉王昔垂钓，白龙从天来。\n至今龙起处，犹傍汉王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园","author":"郑善夫","text":"汶口园仍好，商于草已芜。\n谁歌采芝曲，高调满江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"郑善夫","text":"商意变绿荷，秋风落江渚。\n零露忽泥人，愁闻鹡鸰语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中杂诗二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"秋浦下鸿雁，秋风鸣芰荷。\n客怀一万里，江月夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中杂诗二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"乌衣不复见，蟋蟀声近床。\n黄花深几许，昨夜一篱霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行五首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"冰合如镜平，冰断如雷鸣。\n孤舟不得寐，枕上悲风生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行五首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"厌见雪如麻，不见梅放花。\n江北是客路，江南是客家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行五首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"闭门对孤灯，开门见明星。\n默默心底事，礧磈谁能平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行五首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"宦海多白波，客路多黄尘。\n波白解覆舟，尘黄解污人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行五首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"少年爱春日，羯鼓闹春盘。\n一自不家食，春盘岁岁閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟三首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"浣纱伤妾貌，折花伤妾心。\n郎君不相弃，请听白头吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟三首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"白头人所贱，绿发人须恋。\n君如恋绿发，莫到白头变。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫吟三首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"爱君如爱天，事君期尽年。\n妾意无虚假，君看塘上篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"郑善夫","text":"谁家玉面女，素足立水傍。\n眷言新岁近，作意浣衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题三首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"悄悄风色寒，白地不敢看。\n天尾是故国，天头是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题三首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"叹息复叹息，泪沾头上巾。\n青萍将底用，光掩属车尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题三首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"明月岂长好，的的入我怀。\n东风不爱情，浮云与意乖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔者","author":"郑善夫","text":"白日下广川，烟涛去不还。\n平生钓鱼意，入手便忘筌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虹桥","author":"郑善夫","text":"虹桥不可渡，东断蓬山阳。\n只有宾云曲，流音下大荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶州吟二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻渡韶阳水，沧溟水更深。\n娵媀时入馔，莫作百蛮音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶州吟二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"蛮溪枫叶下，蛮女答歌还。\n太平无外患，何事百牢关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闭门四首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"闭门打乖坐，鹊噪庭下槐。\n种竹成琅玕，天风飒然来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闭门四首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"晓起披云气，摊书青涧阿。\n六经无一字，秪道配江河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闭门四首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"读易苦解事，阅世涕横臆。\n如何中天日，未见群阴息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闭门四首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"葺彼南阳庐，潇洒玩世事。\n平生梁甫篇，吟对沧浪水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"皎皎水上仙，风吹入我怀。\n我梦逢姹女，洛波堕弓鞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"边人竞北风，牧马阴山阳。\n腰间宝刀赤，河清尔来王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"头陀戏海蟾，手握庵摩果。\n大观天地间，一笑吾丧我。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"鸲鹆乘天巧，幽篁学语繁。\n江南气候正，莫过鲁东门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"卖药行市南，隐身入壶中。\n指挥费长房，白日骑黄龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画六绝 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"六拍按六气，广乐音未希。\n举手谢世人，行歌绿云归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"掩书卧玄冥，蟋蟀在床头。\n如何闭关月，耳畔鸣不休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"形骸久为累，三尸今晏然。\n安得鲁仲尼，展转铸颜渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"虞卿为著书，卒岁坐穷愁。\n那知交字外，翻有逍遥游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"有身终是尽，学死始长生。\n吾将鍊真性，去去凌紫清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"爱河易漂溺，三山波浪翻。\n觅心了无得，吾今闭吾关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中吟六绝 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"诗书破我拙，聪明多事起。\n那复黜聪明，返我混沌子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏叹五首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"少年逐铅椠，学道苦不早。\n眼看春田花，谁是长久好。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏叹五首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"密云不成霖，西郊气烘烘。\n女其蛟与龙，胡为处池中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏叹五首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"穷年守庚申，服食意未已。\n如何三尸虫，犹在腹心里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏叹五首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"生亦何所喜，死亦何所悲。\n言脱生死关，短脩复谁尸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏叹五首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"中岁闻大道，鍊已成蹉跎。\n去日一以多，来日今若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞霄","author":"郑善夫","text":"白鹤久辞华表，青牛已度函关。\n五内天花未饱，麻鞋踏尽名山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邵二泉绣岭草堂二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"湘山寂寂楚猿啼，湘水迢迢过客悲。\n何处筼筜不愁思，邵公惠麓武公淇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邵二泉绣岭草堂二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"茶仙品泉泉为寒，泉翁爱泉泉出山。\n只欲逃名逃不得，许多甘冽在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登北固楼","author":"郑善夫","text":"北固楼前鹅鹳风，奔涛蹴汐撼龙宫。\n舟楫是非京口渡，关河忧患海陵烽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游焦山","author":"郑善夫","text":"焦丘龙卧浪冥冥，瓜步云回海树青。\n风尘重问焦光洞，读罢华阳瘗鹤铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"沙棠为楫桂为船，紫嶂丹厓锦映川。\n我是开元李居士，铁龙吹散万峰烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"不道巫阳十二峰，玉环珠佩净云容。\n美人婉婉秋波立，迥隔天关百二重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"蜕骨藏真传此岩，土花石黛已?毵。\n那能县绠探金槥，下捣龙宫万仞潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"大隐屏前烟水深，九霄云覆紫芝林。\n彤墀不作含香梦，丹洞忻传出世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其七","author":"郑善夫","text":"水过苍屏湾对湾，山形密似百年关。\n巨鳌不戴东溟去，要与乾坤作大闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其八","author":"郑善夫","text":"博罗东下三百滩，喷雪奔雷仰面看。\n虬龙不出蝮蛇出，天风下来吹岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其九","author":"郑善夫","text":"石鼓云楼天汉开，飞泉几道白龙洄。\n探元笑入桃源路，黄叶千岩风雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20002,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷曲次晦翁棹歌十首 其十","author":"郑善夫","text":"九溪历尽兴翛然，乱瀑喧豗赴锦川。\n寻源已到明河曲，飞舄还过一字天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20003,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵","author":"郑善夫","text":"紫禁金门闭寂寥，不闻清乐下丹霄。\n高皇事业如天地，过客何须话六朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20004,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧","author":"郑善夫","text":"黄帽青鞋何处寻，道人高卧南山阴。\n閒诵维摩一百偈，白雪床前三尺深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20005,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林仲颖赴马平","author":"郑善夫","text":"东浮淮海三千丈，南过罗浮四百峰。\n知尔欲寻勾漏令，会看鸡犬白云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20006,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈侍御使广","author":"郑善夫","text":"岭南巨海散溟濛，海上罗浮四百峰。\n炎瘴直须三尺雪，鳄鱼先避五花骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20007,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棹歌四首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"鸿雁飞来风雪心，鸿雁飞去天山阴。\n二月天山风雪浅，六月天山风雪深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20008,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棹歌四首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"鸿雁飞去稻粱荒，白鸥不飞羽毛伤。\n天寒日暮黄芦荡，江水渺茫心渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20009,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棹歌四首 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"送君把君绿荷衣，悲莫悲兮生别离。\n衢阳向上江水绝，纵有鲤鱼何处来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20010,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棹歌四首 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"青螺江头游子吟，黄金台上秋水深。\n风尘一别一万里，美人驾车伤我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20011,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]